[I] Tiny multicast testing tool

[T] mcjoin is a simple and easy-to-use tool to test IPv4 and IPv6 multicast.
[T] It can act as a multicast generator (server) and data sink (client), and
[T] supports joining and sending to one or more groups using any-source
[T] (ASM) and source-specific (SSM) multicast.

[U] https://github.com/troglobit/mcjoin

[A] Mcjoin Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

